# run_cepm.ps1 -m (multistep) per-batch working files
# Generated at the start of phase B and removed again by the script's own
# cleanup step, so they normally only exist mid-run -- but that is exactly when
# they clutter the staging area, and an interrupted run leaves them behind.
# The token is the batch name, so the names vary per run.
# Keep the checked-in *_none.csv pair, which is the real 'no cap' input.
cases*__*.csv
inputs/growth_constraints/cepm_tg_cap_sys_*.csv
inputs/growth_constraints/cepm_tg_cap_reg_*.csv
!inputs/growth_constraints/cepm_tg_cap_sys_none.csv
!inputs/growth_constraints/cepm_tg_cap_reg_none.csv
